msgstr "Container configuration is read at each Portainer or Kubernetes import."

msgid "Le plugin ne modifie rien sur les plateformes."
msgstr "The plugin changes nothing on the platforms."

msgid "Lus au prochain import"
msgstr "Read at the next import"

msgid "Pas encore analysés"
msgstr "Not analysed yet"

